          },
          "text": "A section of Church Street is officially a pedestrian zone for the next nine weeks - and the street is all yours to enjoy!  \n\nFrom Wellesley Street East to Alexander Street, the road is closed to vehicles and open for walking, gathering, and enjoying summer in the area. \n\nResidents and drivers should expect changes and plan for extra travel time. We’re using clear signage, updated traffic signals, and real-time traffic management to help keep things moving. \n\nLearn more about the pilot: https://t.co/GB9ibh12vG"
